  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Abu Dhabi University (ADU) is a private comprehensive university established in 2003 with its main campus in Abu Dhabi, UAE, and additional campuses in Al Ain and Dubai. ADU enrols approximately 8,000 students from over 70 countries, making it one of the most internationally diverse universities in the UAE.",
      "ADU is organised into five colleges — College of Business, College of Engineering, College of Health Sciences, College of Arts, Education and Social Sciences, and College of Law — along with an English Language Institute. The College of Business holds dual AACSB and EQUIS accreditation, and the College of Engineering programs are accredited by ABET.",
      "Programs span business, engineering, computer science, AI, cybersecurity, architecture, health sciences, social sciences, mass communication and law. ADU is ranked among the top universities in the UAE in QS Arab Region Rankings and QS World University Rankings, with particular strength in Business and Engineering.",
      "The university maintains a strong international focus through partnerships with UK, US and Australian universities, exchange programs, and a multicultural faculty of more than 145 academics. ADU campuses combine modern teaching facilities, research labs, sports infrastructure and on-campus residences for international students."
    ],
    "paragraphsRu": [
      "Abu Dhabi University (ADU) — частный комплексный университет, основанный в 2003 году. Главный кампус расположен в Абу-Даби (ОАЭ), дополнительные — в Аль-Айне и Дубае. В ADU учатся около 8 000 студентов из более чем 70 стран, что делает его одним из самых международно разнообразных университетов ОАЭ.",
      "ADU включает пять колледжей — College of Business, College of Engineering, College of Health Sciences, College of Arts, Education and Social Sciences и College of Law, а также English Language Institute. College of Business имеет двойную аккредитацию AACSB и EQUIS, а инженерные программы College of Engineering аккредитованы ABET.",
      "Программы охватывают бизнес, инженерные специальности, computer science, AI, cybersecurity, архитектуру, health sciences, социальные науки, mass communication и право. ADU входит в число лидирующих университетов ОАЭ в QS Arab Region Rankings и QS World University Rankings, особенно сильны Business и Engineering.",
      "Университет поддерживает выраженный международный фокус: партнёрства с университетами Великобритании, США и Австралии, обменные программы и мультикультурный состав преподавателей — более 145 академиков. Кампусы ADU сочетают современные учебные корпуса, исследовательские лаборатории, спортивную инфраструктуру и резиденции для иностранных студентов."
    ],
    "keyFacts": [
      "Founded 2003 — private comprehensive university",
      "~8,000 students from 70+ countries",
      "5 colleges + English Language Institute",
      "College of Business: AACSB + EQUIS dual accreditation",
      "College of Engineering: ABET accreditation",
      "Bachelor of Architecture: RIBA accreditation",
      "Campuses in Abu Dhabi, Al Ain and Dubai",
      "Ranked among top UAE universities in QS World Rankings"
    ],
